224 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 179 0 R
/E (The main goal of SafeStep is to help women feel safer when they are alone, traveling, or in potentially dangerous situations. In many cases, women may not have enough time to make a phone call during an emergency. SafeStep simplifies the process by allowing them to request help instantly with just one tap.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
225 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 179 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
226 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 179 0 R
/E (By combining modern mobile technology with a clear focus on safety, SafeStep contributes to building smarter and safer communities while supporting digital innovation in personal security.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
